                <head>346. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On March 13 Ambassador Yost sent Secretary Dulles at Bangkok the suggested text
                    of a personal message to Crown Prince Savang Vatthana for his consideration; see
                        <ref target="#d97">Document 97</ref>. In telegram 343 from Saigon (where the
                    Secretary was March 14–15), March 14, Dulles authorized Yost to deliver the
                    message to Savang as a personal communication from Dulles. The Secretary made
                    one deletion in the suggested text which is explained in <ref target="#d97-f4"
                        >footnote 4, Document 97</ref>. The message was delivered on March 15.</p>
            </div>
